{"annotations": [], "blocks": [{"bbox": [49.6066, 35.45114879999994, 372.67446692578034, 42.12895800000001], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 0, "source": "docling", "text": "Wang et al."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 74.54899999999998, 272.02585255000025, 79.93349999999998], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "caption", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 1, "source": "docling", "text": "TABLE 1  Participants ' demographic background and medical information at baseline."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 236.18099999999993, 292.57490800000005, 256.9208], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 2, "source": "docling", "text": "was  more  effective  in  enhancing  tooth  color  compared  to  the treatment given to the control group."}, {"bbox": [49.60605999999996, 260.21799999999996, 292.67335299999996, 436.9211], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 3, "source": "docling", "text": "Intra group comparison showed that for the control group, the W* values at each time point (Baseline, Day 1, Day 3, and Day 14) showed  no  statistically significant differences ( P > 0.05). This suggests  that  there  was  no  significant  change  in  tooth  color  for the control group over the course of the study. For the treatment group, however, the W* values demonstrated statistically  significant  differences  within  the  group  across  the different  time  points  ( P < 0.05).  The  W*  values  at  Day  1,  Day  3, and  Day  14  were  all  found  to  be  better  than  at  the  baseline. Additionally,  the  W*  values  at  Day  3  and  Day  14  were  both superior  to  those  at  Day  1,  and  the  values  at  Day  14  showing the  most  significant  improvement  over  the  initial  measurement ( P < 0.05). This indicates a progressive and significant improvement  in  tooth  color  for  the  treatment  group  over  the 14-day evaluation period (Table 2, Figure 2)."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 456.602, 267.79386410000006, 461.6983846153846], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "caption", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 4, "source": "docling", "text": "TABLE 2  Comparison of W* values among two groups during different time points."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 585.2741176, 51.575792215728, 589.4725039], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 5, "source": "docling", "text": "*"}, {"bbox": [51.5906, 586.8699326, 56.2381715, 592.8323684294944], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 6, "source": "docling", "text": "p"}, {"bbox": [56.012480000000004, 586.6229288, 73.21166724880999, 592.9215257], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 7, "source": "docling", "text": "< 0.05."}, {"bbox": [49.6063, 594.2321176, 75.19609790482, 601.8785257], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 8, "source": "docling", "text": "** p < 0.01."}, {"bbox": [304.724, 233.60507440000003, 517.6637506872903, 257.0709790000001], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 9, "source": "docling", "text": "Vita shade guide color value: primary outcomes assessment"}, {"bbox": [304.72478, 272.125, 547.7922808999999, 436.8664000000001], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 10, "source": "docling", "text": "The secondary outcomes assessment was based on the VITA 3D-Master  shade  guide  color  values  (hereinafter  referred  to  as VITA  color  values).  Upon  inter-group  comparison,  the  VITA color  values  at  baseline  and  Day  1  for  the  treatment  group  and the  control  group  showed  no  statistically  significant  differences ( P > 0.05).  This  indicates  that  the  two  groups  were  comparable in  terms  of  tooth  color  at  the  outset  of  the  study.  However,  at Day  3  and  14,  the  VITA  color  values  between  the  two  groups demonstrated statistically significant differences ( P < 0.05). Specifically,  the  treatment  group  exhibited  a  more  pronounced decrease  in  VITA  color  values  compared  to  the  control  group, which  implies  that  the  teeth  of  the  treatment  group  became lighter  and  closer  to  the  reference  white  color  provided  by  the VITA shade guide."}, {"bbox": [304.72496000000007, 440.162, 547.86527352, 700.8836999999999], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 11, "source": "docling", "text": "Intra-group comparisons of the VITA color values at different time points within each group showed the following results. For the  treatment  group,  the  VITA  color  values  at  each  time  point (Day 1, Day 3, Day 14) were all statistically significantly different from the baseline values ( P < 0.05), indicating a progressive  whitening  effect  over  time.  Additionally,  the  VITA color  values  at  Day  3  were  significantly  different  from  those  at Day  1,  and  the  values  at  Day  14  were  significantly  different from  those  at  Day  3  ( P < 0.05),  demonstrating  a  continued improvement in bleaching as the study progressed. And a color difference  value  higher  than  2.5  is  considered  significant  (15, 16).  For  the  control  group,  the  VITA  color  values  at  baseline were found to be statistically different from those at Day 1, Day 3,  and  Day  14  ( P < 0.05).  Specifically,  the  VITA  color  values  at Day 1,  3,  and  14  were  all  lighter  compared  to  the  baseline,  but this  change  in  tooth  color  is  not  significant.  When  comparing the  VITA  color  values  between  Day  1  and  Day  3,  Day  1  and Day  14, Day  3  and  Day  14  within  the  control  group,  no statistically significant differences were observed ( P > 0.05). This  implies  that  there  was  no  further  significant  change  in tooth color within the observation period in the control group (Table 3, Figure 3)."}, {"bbox": [304.724, 732.5590744, 406.1401144586702, 744.006979], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 12, "source": "docling", "text": "Safety assessment"}, {"bbox": [304.725, 759.1168, 547.7286015300002, 779.7995], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 5, "seq": 13, "source": "docling", "text": "The analysis indicated that, throughout the clinical trial, a total of five AEs were reported by five participants, all of which resolved"}], "checksum": "245c378c5507bbcc7b18a32f4f89f1999a14413523df7a4aa56a5e7ba41bcc03", "content_present": true, "doc_id": "d-ffae5e192586c330", "docling_version": "2.118.0", "engine_version": "2.118.0", "errors": [], "images": [{"bbox": [48.831263400343474, 619.7623563812616, 290.8796017755105, 774.3017375148089], "blob": "", "caption": "", "checksum": "4e0f4fc0e431edd5baee681b45c395d2aa63f19cd4445fc4b012b1d72d8f7efa", "mime": "image/png", "page": 5, "storage_ref": ""}], "page_index": 4, "page_sizes": {"5": [595.280029296875, 841.8900146484375]}, "route": "docling", "schema_version": "v0.1.0", "source_hash": "ffae5e192586c330b0f1ca378793890d7f63ed378c5e49098e39ab7cfeaeccc9", "status": "ok", "tables": [{"bbox": [48.5315885844977, 84.33593661479222, 546.4068798901905, 207.98300650480678], "body_bottom": 204.64494860000002, "caption": "TABLE 1 Participants ' demographic background and medical information at baseline.", "cell_bboxes": [[[54.8785, 109.64914240000007, 87.59232149267999, 116.43194860000006], [138.896, 109.64914240000007, 170.62762635620